WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:02.810
Um, let's review what happened last time.

00:06.140 --> 00:07.140
Good morning.

00:09.030 --> 00:10.780
What?!

00:12.360 --> 00:15.439
I want to go out with
a high-school girl, too!

00:15.440 --> 00:17.090
Hurry up and win her over!

00:17.680 --> 00:19.639
Hori-san and Miyamura-kun
is about to start!

00:19.640 --> 00:21.420
Is about to start.

00:22.820 --> 00:24.180
Oh yeah, Iura.

00:23.331 --> 00:27.460
LIVE-EVIL FANSUBS Presents

00:24.710 --> 00:26.060
About today's homework...

00:45.850 --> 00:46.980
Hori-san.

00:49.190 --> 00:53.940
A Kind Person

00:54.450 --> 00:56.690
I can carry that myself, Hori-san.

00:58.950 --> 01:01.579
Are you mad about earlier?

01:01.580 --> 01:03.489
You're so cute, Miyamura-kun!

01:03.490 --> 01:05.639
Did Hori-san cut your hair?

01:05.640 --> 01:07.959
Uh... yeah.

01:07.960 --> 01:09.440
No, not really.

01:10.250 --> 01:12.210
But you hit me, though.

01:12.800 --> 01:20.800
Ouch!!

01:14.010 --> 01:16.129
It bothers me!

01:16.130 --> 01:17.939
Just because you cut your hair,

01:17.940 --> 01:20.869
they're being all clingy
with you every day!

01:20.870 --> 01:23.060
Stop touching him, for crying out loud!

01:23.660 --> 01:25.500
But that's not how I really feel.

01:30.380 --> 01:31.380
Miyamura?

01:31.850 --> 01:33.250
It is you, Miyamura.

01:36.070 --> 01:38.559
Hey, you've grown taller.

01:38.560 --> 01:40.719
So have you been doing well?

01:40.720 --> 01:43.240
Yeah. Looks like you've both
been doing well, too.

01:43.550 --> 01:46.910
You calling me by my name is sickening!

01:48.080 --> 01:50.519
Trying to act cool because
you're in high school now?

01:50.520 --> 01:52.329
How stupid can you be?

01:52.330 --> 01:53.839
Anyway, that...

01:53.840 --> 01:56.870
You make girls carry your stuff?

01:57.400 --> 01:59.889
Oh, it's because she's
weaker than you, huh?

01:59.890 --> 02:03.890
Stop it, Tanihara. She
might be his girlfriend.

02:07.520 --> 02:09.719
Looks like you scored.

02:09.720 --> 02:12.030
Good for you, Miyamura.

02:13.480 --> 02:15.070
At least say something.

02:16.000 --> 02:18.019
Are you done talking?

02:18.020 --> 02:20.659
Hey, are you Miyamura's girlfriend?

02:20.660 --> 02:24.659
Did you know he used to be really
gloomy during junior high?

02:24.660 --> 02:27.009
I said, are you done talking?

02:27.010 --> 02:28.010
Yikes!

02:28.540 --> 02:31.790
You dumbass high schoolers!

02:36.530 --> 02:41.239
First of all, I was in a bad mood, right?

02:41.240 --> 02:42.249
Yeah.

02:42.250 --> 02:45.519
Because they were
making fun of you, you see...

02:45.520 --> 02:46.830
Do you feel better now?

02:53.510 --> 02:55.270
Why are you laughing?!

02:59.410 --> 03:02.059
You picked on him again, didn't you?

03:02.060 --> 03:03.950
You should stop doing that now.

03:04.290 --> 03:06.829
Don't underestimate
Miyamura's current defenses.

03:06.830 --> 03:10.040
What?! Is she like a familiar
he summoned or something?!

03:14.590 --> 03:16.300
Okay, let me see your foot.

03:16.690 --> 03:18.170
What's with the nail polish?

03:18.760 --> 03:21.930
I thought it would look good on you.

03:23.830 --> 03:24.920
Okay, the other foot.

03:26.110 --> 03:27.750
I said, the other foot.

03:29.720 --> 03:32.319
There was a poisonous bug on your forehead!

03:32.320 --> 03:36.579
Have you heard? If someone places their foot
between your eyebrows, your wish will come true.

03:36.580 --> 03:39.250
Uh... that's funny. My
foot moved by itself!

03:40.190 --> 03:42.030
If I put my foot on your face, I thought...

03:42.860 --> 03:43.860
Um...

03:44.490 --> 03:47.640
I'd get stronger... maybe.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.520
What?

03:50.270 --> 03:53.629
Sorry, I lied. You're always teasing me,

03:53.630 --> 03:56.499
So I thought I'd return the favor today.

03:56.500 --> 03:59.389
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

03:59.390 --> 04:01.410
You don't have to say it three times.

04:01.960 --> 04:05.079
You're always so calm around me, Miyamura.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.949
It seems like you're forcing yourself.

04:06.950 --> 04:09.220
Are you perhaps... putting on an act?

04:09.600 --> 04:12.439
N-No, that's just how I normally am.

04:12.440 --> 04:17.020
Or should I yell at you
when you get violent?

04:17.360 --> 04:19.380
Like say something like, "Hey!"

04:20.070 --> 04:21.239
Yup!

04:21.240 --> 04:22.790
What? Seriously?

04:23.460 --> 04:24.859
Well, let's try it out.

04:24.860 --> 04:25.700
Take this!

04:25.700 --> 04:26.700
That one...

04:27.390 --> 04:29.959
Th-That hurt. Stop it.

04:29.960 --> 04:32.580
Is that the best you can do?

04:33.470 --> 04:34.810
Oops...

04:40.170 --> 04:42.010
Good morning.

04:44.010 --> 04:46.969
No, just the beginning.

04:46.970 --> 04:49.119
Seriously? No way!

04:49.120 --> 04:51.569
I listened to it like crazy.

04:51.570 --> 04:53.100
Oh, good morning, Miyamura.

04:53.640 --> 04:57.150
Hey, you seem pretty excited, Ishikawa.

05:02.620 --> 05:04.089
What's this?

05:04.090 --> 05:06.709
You're listening to this again, Iura?

05:06.710 --> 05:08.330
I like them too.

05:09.510 --> 05:13.629
Sorry to bother you, Miyamura-kun.
Can I borrow your 2-B textbook?

05:13.630 --> 05:16.989
What's wrong, Student Council Prez?
Did you forget yours?

05:16.990 --> 05:18.880
You need to get it together.

05:19.580 --> 05:21.129
Ish-Ishikawa-kun!

05:21.130 --> 05:22.569
Why me?!

05:22.570 --> 05:24.920
What's wrong, Miyamura?

05:25.800 --> 05:26.890
Please kill me...

05:27.890 --> 05:31.769
It's orders from the ice queen, right?

05:31.770 --> 05:36.189
Yeah. She said to talk casually
throughout the entire day.

05:36.190 --> 05:39.669
If you really don't want to,
you should just say so.

05:39.670 --> 05:40.899
Good morning.

05:40.900 --> 05:44.730
Come on, Ishikawa! Get it together!

05:51.030 --> 05:52.619
Huh? It's impossible?

05:52.620 --> 05:55.419
Does that mean I don't get
to see the violent Miyamura?

05:55.420 --> 05:56.749
Violent?!

05:56.750 --> 05:59.000
Her demands are getting more extreme.

05:59.500 --> 06:02.640
Can someone help me carry these documents?

06:10.390 --> 06:12.039
What should we do?

06:12.040 --> 06:13.600
Should we put these down first and...

06:16.070 --> 06:19.899
It's okay if you're trying to act like,
"Yay! I did it!"

06:19.900 --> 06:21.860
But you don't really feel like that, right?

06:26.940 --> 06:29.049
I have to drop these off in the next room.

06:29.050 --> 06:30.599
The physics classroom?

06:30.600 --> 06:31.570
Is the door unlocked?

06:31.570 --> 06:32.410
Huh?

06:32.411 --> 06:36.429
Oh... I guess Nakamine-sensei
isn't there in the afternoon.

06:36.430 --> 06:37.650
Well, guess I'll just wait.

06:47.840 --> 06:51.429
Could this possibly be...

06:51.430 --> 06:55.060
But is it really okay to do this?

06:55.670 --> 06:58.349
Oh! Hey, speaking of which...

06:58.350 --> 07:00.359
Documents? Which ones?

07:00.360 --> 07:01.360
Who knows?

07:02.020 --> 07:04.730
Who do you think you're
talking to?! Shut up!

07:14.710 --> 07:16.529
It's a delinquent!

07:16.530 --> 07:18.070
Sorry for intruding!

07:20.680 --> 07:22.169
Hori-san...

07:22.170 --> 07:24.229
I don't like this.

07:24.230 --> 07:25.750
Just this one time...

07:26.160 --> 07:27.909
She's smiling!

07:27.910 --> 07:29.170
Hori-san, I...

07:29.830 --> 07:31.399
I don't know anymore.

07:31.400 --> 07:32.669
It's okay.

07:32.670 --> 07:34.970
I don't know either.

07:41.560 --> 07:43.639
Can I have one, Tanihara?

07:43.640 --> 07:45.970
Buy some yourself.

07:49.590 --> 07:51.820
Ky-Kyouko-san!

08:00.040 --> 08:02.830
We can't defy Miyamura either!

08:05.790 --> 08:07.689
Just what exactly are we doing?

08:07.690 --> 08:09.760
Or rather, is she really okay?

08:12.520 --> 08:14.220
Listen, Hori-san...

08:15.410 --> 08:16.410
What?

08:23.680 --> 08:26.120
Huh? What's wrong?

08:34.360 --> 08:36.270
What's gotten into you?

08:36.820 --> 08:38.049
Miyamura?

08:38.050 --> 08:40.530
Oh well. Whatever happens, happens.

08:47.460 --> 08:48.909
Take care.

08:48.910 --> 08:50.219
Okay.

08:50.220 --> 08:53.150
Oh, my house is getting renovated,
so I'll be staying at a relative's.

08:53.700 --> 08:56.929
For four or five days after the holiday.

08:56.930 --> 08:58.230
I see...

08:59.710 --> 09:01.110
I'll be back on Friday.

09:02.310 --> 09:03.619
Do they live far away?

09:03.620 --> 09:04.809
In Hokkaido.

09:04.810 --> 09:05.810
What?

09:05.980 --> 09:08.229
I hope the airplane doesn't crash.

09:08.230 --> 09:11.189
Hey, don't say something like that.

09:11.190 --> 09:14.009
Sorry. I'll buy you a present.

09:14.010 --> 09:15.029
See ya.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.069
Hey...

09:16.070 --> 09:16.960
Huh?

09:16.960 --> 09:17.960
Uh...

09:18.350 --> 09:20.299
I'll take notes for you.

09:20.300 --> 09:22.030
Okay. Thanks.

09:44.020 --> 09:44.058
Contacts

09:45.429 --> 09:45.480
Enter

09:45.480 --> 09:49.230
- None - Good morning. I bet you're .still
asleep. Starting today, ..I'll be away.

09:45.480 --> 09:47.355
Sub-menu

09:45.480 --> 09:49.230
Contacts

09:45.481 --> 09:47.355
EMAIL

09:47.356 --> 09:49.230
Miyamura

09:47.356 --> 09:49.230
Enter

09:57.360 --> 09:58.360
All right.

10:01.210 --> 10:03.709
It's morning, Souta.

10:03.710 --> 10:05.050
Wake up!

10:17.910 --> 10:19.019
Good morning.

10:19.020 --> 10:20.109
Good morning.

10:20.110 --> 10:21.110
Morning.

10:21.520 --> 10:22.100
Good morning.

10:22.101 --> 10:23.180
Good morning.

10:36.610 --> 10:38.309
Good morning, Hori.

10:38.310 --> 10:39.519
Good morning.

10:39.520 --> 10:44.250
Sorry, Hori! Can I copy
your English homework?

10:45.200 --> 10:48.339
I forgot that Miyamura
wouldn't be here today!

10:48.340 --> 10:50.829
Oh! She has an order about who she asks?

10:50.830 --> 10:51.750
That's right.

10:51.751 --> 10:54.580
Seriously?! Oh man, is that how it works?

10:56.230 --> 10:57.930
Whoa! You're good, Tohru!

11:01.510 --> 11:03.649
Okay, the next part please, Ishikawa.

11:03.650 --> 11:04.720
Okay.

11:05.090 --> 11:10.639
Um... Everyone has... his or her...

11:10.640 --> 11:13.399
sp-special incident...

11:13.400 --> 11:15.259
"Specific."

11:15.260 --> 11:18.079
It means something precise or definite.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.780
A specific incident...

11:20.110 --> 11:22.869
Did you really translate this
before coming to school?

11:22.870 --> 11:26.059
Well, it's because I forgot Miyamura
wasn't going to be here today.

11:26.060 --> 11:27.809
I swear I really finished it.

11:27.810 --> 11:29.070
Don't rely on him too much.

11:35.090 --> 11:35.210
- EMAIL
- Miyamura

11:35.090 --> 11:35.210
- None
- I'm leaving on the 12:28 PM flight.

11:35.460 --> 11:38.210
- None
- I'm leaving on the 12:28 PM flight.

11:35.463 --> 11:36.835
EMAIL

11:36.836 --> 11:38.210
Miyamura

11:47.180 --> 11:49.909
Huh? Miyamura-kun isn't here?

11:49.910 --> 11:51.609
Want to use my tracksuit?

11:51.610 --> 11:53.419
It's the shorts and
short-sleeved shirt one.

11:53.420 --> 11:55.569
Not sure about the
shirt and shorts version...

11:55.570 --> 11:56.570
Want to use mine?

11:56.571 --> 11:59.699
No, no, I couldn't possibly borrow yours.

11:59.700 --> 12:01.150
Wanna borrow mine?

12:01.860 --> 12:03.829
Don't just come out of nowhere, Iura-kun!

12:03.830 --> 12:05.709
What if I get a heart attack?!

12:05.710 --> 12:06.849
What?

12:06.850 --> 12:08.459
I'd give you CPR.

12:08.460 --> 12:09.769
No, thank you.

12:09.770 --> 12:13.059
You say that, but you'd rather
borrow one from a girl, right?

12:13.060 --> 12:14.060
What?!

12:15.040 --> 12:16.959
Seriously, Sengoku?

12:16.960 --> 12:19.169
I'm gonna tell Remi-chan.

12:19.170 --> 12:20.999
That's not true!

12:21.000 --> 12:23.390
- She's really scary when she gets mad.
- Uh, no, that's not...

12:23.393 --> 12:25.260
I said...

12:23.910 --> 12:25.260
You're so...

12:28.080 --> 12:29.249
See ya!

12:29.250 --> 12:30.429
See you later!

12:30.430 --> 12:31.549
Okay.

12:31.550 --> 12:33.340
Let's stop by the convenience store, Toru.

12:50.930 --> 12:54.000
Um... Miyamura-kun's absent.

13:45.140 --> 13:48.089
Sorry for making you help out.

13:48.090 --> 13:49.269
It's okay.

13:49.270 --> 13:51.309
I'm tired.

13:51.310 --> 13:52.560
Geez.

13:53.100 --> 13:54.620
Do you want to take a break?

13:55.470 --> 13:56.640
Sure!

13:57.060 --> 13:58.299
I want to drink some juice!

13:58.300 --> 13:59.460
Okay, then let's go buy some.

14:59.731 --> 15:00.960
STRAWBERRY MILK

15:01.870 --> 15:04.369
They just have a few extra legs.

15:04.370 --> 15:06.199
Not just a few!

15:06.200 --> 15:08.220
They have eight legs!

15:08.950 --> 15:11.629
I'm sure it's just a daddy long-legs.

15:11.630 --> 15:13.759
Let's go take a look at it.

15:13.760 --> 15:14.760
What?

15:16.080 --> 15:16.440
No.

15:16.441 --> 15:17.769
Come on, hurry up!

15:17.770 --> 15:19.329
No, it's...

15:19.330 --> 15:20.839
What?

15:20.840 --> 15:22.599
Oh! It's Hori-san.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.820
Are you waiting for someone, Kyou-chan?

15:25.690 --> 15:26.700
Not really.

15:36.660 --> 15:39.999
Are you doing that to
annoy your father, Kyouko?

15:40.000 --> 15:40.770
Huh?

15:40.771 --> 15:43.080
That's not Papa's bowl.

15:44.060 --> 15:45.219
Sorry.

15:45.220 --> 15:49.009
My! There's a severe rainstorm
warning in Hokkaido.

15:49.010 --> 15:51.970
I wonder if Izumi-kun will be
able to get home all right.

16:04.720 --> 16:09.169
The phone that you're trying
to reach is out of range,

16:09.170 --> 16:12.030
or the power is turned off.
Your call can't be completed.

16:25.680 --> 16:28.279
Ik-kun. Ik-kun!

16:28.280 --> 16:29.840
Huh? What?

16:30.210 --> 16:32.909
Why don't you ask for a ride?

16:32.910 --> 16:35.350
You can buy a charging cable
at the convenience store, right?

16:35.910 --> 16:36.910
No.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.790
That's okay.

16:39.850 --> 16:42.600
Really? If you need a
ride there, just say so.

17:00.620 --> 17:04.069
Miyamura's supposed
to come back today, right?

17:04.070 --> 17:05.919
As I recall, this evening, right?

17:05.920 --> 17:07.209
I'm not too sure.

17:07.210 --> 17:07.210
What?

17:07.840 --> 17:09.519
He didn't tell you?

17:09.520 --> 17:10.670
Yeah...

17:21.560 --> 17:23.290
NEXT FLIGHT

17:21.560 --> 17:23.290
Destination/Transit Point

17:21.560 --> 17:23.290
Flight

17:21.560 --> 17:23.290
HANEDA

17:23.291 --> 17:25.020
CURRENT TIME

17:23.291 --> 17:25.020
Arrival

17:23.291 --> 17:25.020
Notice

17:23.291 --> 17:25.020
Delays due to rainy weather

17:25.040 --> 17:26.380
CURRENT TIME

17:26.381 --> 17:27.720
NEXT FLIGHT

17:36.980 --> 17:38.990
Did Miyamura contact you yet?

17:40.290 --> 17:41.370
Nope.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.709
What the hell is Miyamura doing?

17:49.710 --> 17:51.250
I'm gonna call him.

17:51.640 --> 17:53.960
You're not going to be able
to get through to him.

17:56.890 --> 17:58.480
I'm just going to head home.

18:25.870 --> 18:29.250
INBOX

18:25.870 --> 18:29.250
Shindo

18:25.870 --> 18:30.789
Shindo

18:25.870 --> 18:29.579
Shindo

18:26.830 --> 18:29.449
Whoa! They're all from Shindo!

18:29.450 --> 18:32.630
Shindo... Shindo... Ishikawa-kun.

18:29.580 --> 18:30.789
Ishikawa

18:30.790 --> 18:32.630
Ishikawa

18:30.790 --> 18:32.630
Shindo

18:33.130 --> 18:35.329
"The test has been postponed."

18:35.330 --> 18:36.330
Great.

18:36.960 --> 18:39.590
INBOX

18:47.690 --> 18:50.030
Hey, about the bag
with the gifts in them...

18:51.470 --> 18:52.530
Ik-kun?

19:14.160 --> 19:17.000
OPEN

19:16.000 --> 19:17.000
CLOSE

19:26.010 --> 19:29.060
I'll be back on Friday?

19:48.830 --> 19:49.920
H-Hori-san!

20:20.460 --> 20:21.770
Welcome back.

20:22.750 --> 20:24.040
Huh? Um...

20:25.520 --> 20:26.540
I'm back.

20:37.890 --> 20:45.089
Nee oboeteiru no kimi to

20:37.890 --> 20:45.089
Hey, do you remember

20:45.090 --> 20:48.260
deatta hi wo

20:45.090 --> 20:48.260
the first time we met?

20:49.330 --> 20:56.349
zutto wasurenaide to kimi wa

20:49.330 --> 20:56.349
You always kept on saying,

20:56.350 --> 21:04.350
itte ita ne hai iro ga atta keshiki ga

20:56.350 --> 21:04.350
"Don't forget about it", right?
The grey-colored scenery

21:04.730 --> 21:12.730
ima wa azayaka ni irozuku
ikisaki wo kandou shita yubi

21:04.730 --> 21:12.730
is full of color now. I was excited
about where we were heading,

21:16.120 --> 21:21.729
furuete ita kedo

21:16.120 --> 21:21.729
but my fingers were shaking.

21:21.730 --> 21:29.730
houkago ni yakusoku shiyo kyou
wa doko e yuku no furi sosogu

21:21.730 --> 21:29.730
Let's make plans to go somewhere
together after school. If we walk down

21:32.980 --> 21:40.980
hizashi namiki michi arukeba
minna ni aeru kara ureshikute toki

21:32.980 --> 21:40.980
the bright tree-lined street,
we'll meet the others. I felt so happy.

21:46.180 --> 21:54.180
doki kuchizusaunda yasashii uta wo kyou mo

21:46.180 --> 21:54.180
Today again, I hummed a
gentle song from time to time.

22:09.200 --> 22:11.269
Hey! Where do you
think you're throwing it?!

22:11.270 --> 22:13.680
You need to catch it properly!

22:17.020 --> 22:18.900
P.E. has already started.

22:19.750 --> 22:21.410
My P.E. clothes got thrown away.

22:21.950 --> 22:23.230
So...

22:24.460 --> 22:25.779
Who are you?

22:25.780 --> 22:27.990
Well, I'll ask you the same thing.

22:29.420 --> 22:30.659
I'm Miyamura.

22:30.660 --> 22:34.120
Seriously? My name's Miyamura, too.

22:38.430 --> 22:41.350
I hate cheerful people.

22:43.450 --> 22:44.640
Yeah, you're right.

22:46.370 --> 22:49.009
I also hate people who hang out in groups.

22:49.010 --> 22:52.970
It's because it makes you feel
like you're being shunned.

22:53.650 --> 22:55.600
I hate breaks between classes, too.

22:55.910 --> 23:01.059
Because it makes you feel like
you're isolating yourself from the others.

23:01.060 --> 23:05.530
Looking back, there wasn't
a single thing I enjoyed.

23:05.900 --> 23:09.110
I always thought that
it would be better if I didn't exist.

23:12.170 --> 23:14.630
No one needs me, do they?

23:16.040 --> 23:17.489
Can I kill myself?

23:17.490 --> 23:20.960
No, I don't think you should do that.

23:21.300 --> 23:23.630
You may not realize it now,

23:23.950 --> 23:26.610
but you're going to become
friends with someone soon.

23:27.380 --> 23:29.090
She's really fussy, though.

23:32.340 --> 23:37.280
Also, a boy who's tall and nice, and a girl
who cares dearly about her friends.

23:37.720 --> 23:41.649
A cowardly student council president
and two people that are close friends.

23:41.650 --> 23:43.780
You'll make lots of other friends, too.

23:44.830 --> 23:46.070
Really?

23:46.380 --> 23:47.659
Yeah.

23:47.660 --> 23:52.319
Also, a person who always laughs
and cries about the things you do.

23:52.320 --> 23:55.999
A person who gets mad and depressed
and then scolds you.

23:56.000 --> 23:57.679
I'm not sure why,

23:57.680 --> 24:00.820
but she hangs out with
a gloomy guy like you.

24:05.420 --> 24:07.460
If that's true,

24:09.130 --> 24:10.130
I...

24:22.710 --> 24:24.870
I want to see Hori-san.

24:57.390 --> 25:00.459
Are you coming home
late today, too, Ik-kun?

25:00.460 --> 25:02.059
Yeah, probably.

25:02.060 --> 25:04.629
I see. Introduce her to me next time.

25:04.630 --> 25:07.189
Um... her name is Kyouko-chan, right?

25:07.190 --> 25:10.520
Yeah... well, I guess I...

25:11.180 --> 25:12.180
Okay.

25:12.640 --> 25:13.640
I'll do that.

25:20.450 --> 25:21.579
Wait, Mom!

25:21.580 --> 25:24.909
Why do you know about her?!
How did you find out?!

25:24.910 --> 25:28.739
Shindo-kun shops at my workplace a lot.

25:28.740 --> 25:33.010
So did you cut your hair and
stop wearing glasses for her?

25:35.000 --> 25:36.470
See you later!

25:36.870 --> 25:39.380
Shindo!

